  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "命中率 = hit / (hit + miss)，5 分钟窗口，百分比。分母刻意只算 hit 与 miss：bypass（处于失败熔断窗口，本次根本没访问 Redis）与 error（访问 Redis 失败、静默回源）都不计入 —— 否则 Redis 挂掉时命中率会显示成 0%，看起来像「缓存策略坏了」，而实际是「缓存层已熔断、压根没在用缓存」，两者含义完全不同。clamp_min 用于无流量时防除零。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 50
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 80
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.3.1",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(stellar_cache_requests_total{result=\"hit\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(stellar_cache_requests_total{result=~\"hit|miss\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "缓存命中率（hit / (hit + miss)）",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "按 namespace（post / note / comment / tag / stats / meteor / echo / link / user）拆分的命中率，口径同左上角。失效走「命名空间版本号」：一次 INCR 让旧参数的缓存整体不可达，所以每次写操作后对应命名空间的命中率会短暂下探并回升，这是预期行为，不是缓存失效故障。",
